      "value": "can indeed confirm after I recently upgraded from my laptop to a PC with better specs.\nI first thought it was just my laptop getting quite old and not capable of running it anymore,\nbut after the upgrade it still was happening\nbut what I also noticed on my laptop when the fps was really low was that Steam VR also even though slightly started to jitter,\nSo it could also be a Steam VR bug.\nLaptop specs:\ni7-4720HQ, 8GB ram, GTX 980m \nPC specs:\ni7-7700k, 32GB ram, GTX 1080Ti\nVR: Rift CV1",
