      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: I'll just reiterate roughly what I said in the steamvr discussion. It has certainly reduced it enough but after extended use it is possible that more severe shaking can be seen. Ultimately steamvr did a good job having it stable enough to not be annoying but tracking jitter is still perceivable.\nI would conclude though that if steamvr can not resolve this further then the current fix is adequate enough. As someone who has been using the steamvr beta since the fix I have been able to ignore the small jitter that is still present.",
