      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "We have 2023 year, and problem is still in VRChat, on Oculus Software is good, but Oculus+SteamVR making a jitter, you can't add option to VRC to have a OVRToolKit options? Like change height on analog and moving hands etc?\n\nOn Oculus if i get 45FPS, still bones are solid, but on SteamVR i have a small Jitter... this is so annoying, this fix from 2020 doesn't fix a problem at all.",
