  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I noticed that since a little while ago your avatar is shaking/jittering if you use Oculus and play VRChat via SteamVR. It is especially noticeable if your fps drop to 45fps (but i dont mean lag or anything).\nIt works normal if you just use the Oculus Store version. With SteamVR only devices like the Index it also seems to work normal.\nYou can see what i mean in this Video: \nhttps://youtu.be/uHsch2vk7R4\nLeft is with the Oculus store version.\nRight is with the Oculus + SteamVR",
